␀Ğ7#1  ~(€2C12-C2-SŠ=@ª•ª•ª•ª•␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿTøù␀	Info␀ß		Game	Options;␀␀␀␀The aimY␀␀Moving5␀␀Fightingî␀␀Things_␀␀More commandsí␀␀The screenù␀␀Saving‘S␀Save game‘ƒL␀Level mapù„R␀Redraw screen3…Q␀QuitJ␀Your nameˆ␀Rogue 5.4.4 by Michael Toy, Ken Arnold and Glenn Wichman.Find the Amulet of Yendor (below level 26) and bring it backto the surface. The Info topic of the MENU tells you how toplay.Z88 version by Jamie Bradbury, 2026.␀Moving, fighting, things, the screen and saving.␀Save, see the whole level, redraw or quit.␀Your name, for the tombstone.␀Rooms are joined by passages. Find the stairs (%) and press >to go down. Gold, potions, scrolls, rings, wands, armour andweapons lie about; monsters (letters) get stronger deeperdown. With the Amulet, < goes back up.␀Cursor keys or h j k l (y u b n diagonally) move. - and adirection runs; + and a cursor key runs until something turnsup. s searches for hidden doors and traps; > and < usestairs.␀Walk into a monster to hit it. F and a direction fights tothe death; t throws, z zaps a wand. Rest (.) to heal.␀i lists what you carry. q quaff, r read, e eat, w wield, Wwear, T take off armour, P put on, R remove a ring, d drop, ccall (name) a thing.␀/ names a symbol. m and a direction moves without picking up;^ and a direction names a trap. , picks up, I shows onething, a repeats a command. ) ] = @ show weapon, armour,rings, state. D lists what you know. +R redraws, +P repeatsthe last message, ESC cancels.␀Messages are on the top line; the map below follows you; yourstate is on the right. M (or +L) shows the whole level, 7rows at a time (j and k move).␀S (or +S) saves to rogue.sav and play goes on. Rogue offersthe saved game when it starts; once restored, the file isdeleted. After you die, a new game starts.␀Draw the screen again.␀Give up this game (Rogue asks first). The application closes.␀Type your name. DEL rubs out, ENTER finishes, ESC keeps theold one.␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿRG88‰áÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÃÀ7Éİ~ş€0ş@!ÇÁÚ’ÁÍÁ!ÇÁÚ’Á!␀␀"yİ!ÿÿ>çH!çÁÂ’Á>ço¯G!¦Áçu!¯ÁçísyÍ±À!ÂÚ’Á:Ø}Gç]!³␀ ~#·(únÀO␀í°ñÖG¯üç!î+#M6␀#x± øÍ2÷!␀å!µÁå!␀␀åÍ,ßÁÁÁİ*yİ|İµ(çQ¯ç!í{yÃHÀ!Ô}6␀#ûçZxÖõÕÍíÀÑñ< õÍßÀĞ>ÿõÍíÀñ=ş ö!Ô}~·7È#ù·ÉGWç]!ğ¿Â¾À#ù~şĞ_␀å!Ô}ãçZápÉ¯2␀ >@␀␀çN8"Í[Á0:␀ o&␀) İåÑs#r!␀ 4~ş8ØÍxÁ7ÉÕİåÍxÁİáÑBç]İ"y·É@␀Õ␀¯çTÑØz·(¸ P ê·É7É!␀ ~·È5o-&␀) ^#VÕİáçQæå!¹Áç	:áç	:ôçÖ¯ç!ÈşgÊ›À¯ÉéRogue␀¯Á␀␀7#1  ~(€2C1␀Rogue needs 24K of free memory.␀Rogue needs an expanded Z88.␀Rogue: a bank is missing.␀RG88‰á
